1
00:01:44,480 --> 00:01:46,760
Tony got someone to pass a message from prison.

2
00:01:48,040 --> 00:01:50,000
Zhuang Yan has earned Ma Jingrong's trust.

3
00:01:51,120 --> 00:01:52,359
Ma Jingrong offered

4
00:01:52,879 --> 00:01:54,000
to break out of prison with Zhuang Yan.

5
00:01:56,480 --> 00:01:57,879
So what do we need to do now?

6
00:01:59,879 --> 00:02:00,879
A prison break...

7
00:02:01,120 --> 00:02:03,519
requires permission from Country M's police.

8
00:02:06,879 --> 00:02:09,240
Then we'll play it for real.

9
00:02:09,840 --> 00:02:11,280
First, a prison break takes money

10
00:02:11,560 --> 00:02:12,520
to bribe the guards.

11
00:02:13,800 --> 00:02:15,039
Ma Jingrong told Tony to find someone

12
00:02:15,039 --> 00:02:17,080
to collect the money from Li Siqi

13
00:02:17,080 --> 00:02:18,400
to bribe the guards.

14
00:02:18,400 --> 00:02:19,719
Once the guards are paid off,

15
00:02:19,719 --> 00:02:22,080
they'll naturally arrange the breakout.

16
00:02:24,360 --> 00:02:26,400
But Jiang Liye is holding Li Siqi.

17
00:02:27,120 --> 00:02:28,879
As for who to send to deal with Jiang Liye,

18
00:02:30,159 --> 00:02:31,159
I haven't thought of anyone yet.

19
00:02:33,960 --> 00:02:36,039
My current cover is Zhuang Yan's wife.

20
00:02:36,759 --> 00:02:37,400
Let me go.

21
00:02:38,400 --> 00:02:38,800
No.

22
00:02:39,280 --> 00:02:41,120
I promised Zhuang Yan I'd keep you safe.

23
00:02:41,400 --> 00:02:43,319
Besides, Ma Jingrong lost Jiang Liye's shipment,

24
00:02:43,560 --> 00:02:44,960
and Jiang Liye detained Li Siqi.

25
00:02:45,159 --> 00:02:46,879
Meeting Jiang Liye right now is extremely dangerous.

26
00:02:47,680 --> 00:02:48,400
If I go,

27
00:02:49,199 --> 00:02:50,319
I'm the one who can best convince

28
00:02:50,319 --> 00:02:51,400
both Jiang Liye and Li Siqi.

29
00:02:51,719 --> 00:02:53,400
Zhuang Yan finally got close to Ma Jingrong.

30
00:02:53,599 --> 00:02:55,439
Whether we can use this to reach Theerade

31
00:02:55,439 --> 00:02:57,000
depends on what we do right now.

32
00:02:59,560 --> 00:03:01,000
I know this operation is dangerous,

33
00:03:01,520 --> 00:03:03,479
but I came to Country M on a mission,

34
00:03:03,800 --> 00:03:04,879
not to be protected.

35
00:03:11,879 --> 00:03:12,840
Having you meet Jiang Liye...

36
00:03:13,639 --> 00:03:14,479
isn't completely out of the question.

37
00:03:15,199 --> 00:03:16,240
Then I'll send two people with you,

38
00:03:16,479 --> 00:03:17,479
posing as your assistants.

39
00:03:18,800 --> 00:03:19,319
No.

40
00:03:19,840 --> 00:03:20,919
If it's truly dangerous,

41
00:03:21,120 --> 00:03:22,400
sending more people won't help.

42
00:03:22,639 --> 00:03:23,719
It'll only complicate matters.

43
00:03:24,080 --> 00:03:25,120
If I go alone,

44
00:03:26,080 --> 00:03:27,120
he'll have fewer suspicions.

45
00:03:27,719 --> 00:03:28,400
Are you sure?

46
00:03:31,759 --> 00:03:32,199
All right.

47
00:03:33,240 --> 00:03:34,319
You go meet Jiang Liye.

48
00:03:34,840 --> 00:03:36,639
I'll coordinate with the Country M police.

49
00:03:36,879 --> 00:03:37,319
Okay.

50
00:03:51,719 --> 00:03:52,680
How are you doing, Miss Li?

51
00:03:52,919 --> 00:03:54,280
Getting used to it here?

52
00:03:55,000 --> 00:03:55,599
Quite well.

53
00:03:59,000 --> 00:04:00,879
You've stayed here for days.

54
00:04:02,120 --> 00:04:03,199
Aren't you bored at all?

55
00:04:03,719 --> 00:04:06,759
Should I find someone to show you around?

56
00:04:07,280 --> 00:04:08,039
No need.

57
00:04:08,560 --> 00:04:09,919
I prefer peace and quiet anyway.

58
00:04:10,560 --> 00:04:12,280
Your place is wonderful, Mr. Jiang.

59
00:04:12,639 --> 00:04:14,479
I wouldn't mind staying here long-term.

60
00:04:15,840 --> 00:04:18,800
Aren't you worried at all?

61
00:04:23,480 --> 00:04:24,680
Life is unpredictable.

62
00:04:25,279 --> 00:04:27,279
No one knows what fate lies ahead.

63
00:04:27,519 --> 00:04:28,759
If every little thing

64
00:04:28,759 --> 00:04:30,000
caused constant worry,

65
00:04:30,279 --> 00:04:32,560
wouldn't someone like you, Mr. Jiang,

66
00:04:34,920 --> 00:04:36,639
be on edge every single day?

67
00:04:41,720 --> 00:04:42,160
Sir.

68
00:04:43,560 --> 00:04:46,079
A lady is here asking to see Miss Li.

69
00:04:50,920 --> 00:04:51,600
Oh?

70
00:04:52,040 --> 00:04:54,879
You have friends in Xilano, Miss Li?

71
00:04:56,560 --> 00:04:57,519
In this place,

72
00:04:58,000 --> 00:04:59,639
Mr. Jiang is my only friend.

73
00:05:02,120 --> 00:05:02,839
Send her away.

74
00:05:04,240 --> 00:05:04,600
No.

75
00:05:07,639 --> 00:05:08,800
Please let her in.

76
00:05:09,920 --> 00:05:11,160
At a time like this,

77
00:05:11,639 --> 00:05:13,720
only one person would send someone for me.

78
00:05:17,040 --> 00:05:19,879
Then I'll check on your behalf, Miss Li.

79
00:05:45,360 --> 00:05:47,839
Wenqing told me all about your situation.

80
00:05:48,560 --> 00:05:50,920
However, I still have a few questions.

81
00:05:51,680 --> 00:05:53,000
I wonder if you, Miss Ge,

82
00:05:53,000 --> 00:05:54,040
could clear them up for me.

83
00:05:55,199 --> 00:05:56,079
Please go ahead, Mr. Jiang.

84
00:05:56,800 --> 00:05:58,720
What did you and your husband

85
00:05:59,160 --> 00:06:01,240
come here for, Miss Ge?

86
00:06:02,519 --> 00:06:04,759
We originally came here for a vacation,

87
00:06:04,920 --> 00:06:06,199
and also to look into

88
00:06:06,199 --> 00:06:07,519
Country M's produce industry.

89
00:06:09,800 --> 00:06:11,920
Vacation. Business research.

90
00:06:11,920 --> 00:06:12,839
And yet,

91
00:06:13,639 --> 00:06:15,879
your husband wound up in prison.

92
00:06:20,519 --> 00:06:23,199
I don't know how it came to this either.

93
00:06:23,759 --> 00:06:25,279
That's why I find it strange too.

94
00:06:25,720 --> 00:06:27,040
You're newcomers here.

95
00:06:27,800 --> 00:06:29,240
How did your husband

96
00:06:29,480 --> 00:06:31,160
manage to get involved

97
00:06:32,040 --> 00:06:34,759
with the local gangs so quickly?

98
00:06:36,040 --> 00:06:37,480
After my husband arrived here,

99
00:06:37,879 --> 00:06:39,439
he met a man named Tony.

100
00:06:39,959 --> 00:06:40,959
But I never expected

101
00:06:40,959 --> 00:06:42,279
that he would drag my husband

102
00:06:42,279 --> 00:06:43,480
into doing something like that.

103
00:06:44,120 --> 00:06:45,399
So you're saying your husband

104
00:06:45,399 --> 00:06:46,480
met someone,

105
00:06:46,800 --> 00:06:49,160
cast his wife aside,

106
00:06:49,639 --> 00:06:54,319
and went off to break the law?

107
00:06:57,480 --> 00:06:58,879
Actually, Mr. Jiang, the truth is,

108
00:06:59,600 --> 00:07:00,879
only after my husband was arrested

109
00:07:01,079 --> 00:07:02,759
did I find out his business back home

110
00:07:02,759 --> 00:07:03,439
had been scammed.

111
00:07:04,560 --> 00:07:06,279
He ended up owing loan sharks a fortune.

112
00:07:06,759 --> 00:07:07,959
Had I known earlier,

113
00:07:07,959 --> 00:07:09,639
I never would've let him take such risks.

114
00:07:11,759 --> 00:07:12,399
That sounds reasonable.

115
00:07:13,079 --> 00:07:15,720
However, I have an alternative theory.

116
00:07:15,720 --> 00:07:18,439
I wonder if you'd care to hear it, Miss Ge.

117
00:07:22,319 --> 00:07:23,720
Ma Jingrong's underling

118
00:07:23,720 --> 00:07:25,959
brought goods to the mainland for a deal,

119
00:07:25,959 --> 00:07:27,600
only to get targeted by the police.

120
00:07:28,000 --> 00:07:30,120
So the police sent an undercover cop

121
00:07:30,439 --> 00:07:32,319
into prison to contact Ma Jingrong.

122
00:07:32,319 --> 00:07:33,079
Naturally,

123
00:07:34,600 --> 00:07:35,720
the target of the police

124
00:07:37,639 --> 00:07:38,920
is Mr. Theerade.

125
00:07:40,079 --> 00:07:40,639
As for you

126
00:07:41,800 --> 00:07:45,639
and your so-called husband in prison,

127
00:07:45,839 --> 00:07:49,519
you're just undercover cops.

128
00:07:54,319 --> 00:07:56,040
My theory makes sense too, doesn't it?

129
00:07:58,279 --> 00:07:59,399
Mr. Jiang, I really don't know

130
00:07:59,399 --> 00:08:00,360
what you're talking about.

131
00:08:01,079 --> 00:08:02,519
It was indeed Mr. Ma Jingrong

132
00:08:02,720 --> 00:08:03,639
who instructed me through Tony

133
00:08:03,959 --> 00:08:05,879
to come here and find Miss Li Siqi.

134
00:08:07,639 --> 00:08:09,160
Why should I believe you?

135
00:08:09,720 --> 00:08:11,160
I just want to save my husband.

136
00:08:11,879 --> 00:08:13,199
So please, Mr. Jiang,

137
00:08:13,399 --> 00:08:15,399
could you take me to see Li Siqi?

138
00:08:16,360 --> 00:08:16,920
Just now...

139
00:08:17,879 --> 00:08:19,279
You just said

140
00:08:19,600 --> 00:08:21,720
your husband owes loan sharks a huge debt,

141
00:08:24,240 --> 00:08:25,920
and now he's in prison.

142
00:08:26,199 --> 00:08:26,959
Do you really think

143
00:08:27,839 --> 00:08:30,079
there's any point in staying together?

144
00:08:31,800 --> 00:08:33,279
With your looks, Miss Ge,

145
00:08:33,639 --> 00:08:34,679
in my eyes,

146
00:08:35,200 --> 00:08:37,320
finding a better man

147
00:08:37,679 --> 00:08:39,159
wouldn't be a problem at all.

148
00:08:42,480 --> 00:08:43,360
I love him very much.

149
00:08:46,480 --> 00:08:49,480
Do you know what true love is?

150
00:08:59,360 --> 00:09:00,080
Sacrifice.

151
00:09:22,960 --> 00:09:24,159
In this gun,

152
00:09:24,720 --> 00:09:26,240
there's only one bullet right now.

153
00:09:26,759 --> 00:09:28,840
I don't know which trigger pull

154
00:09:28,840 --> 00:09:30,360
will fire the bullet.

155
00:09:31,279 --> 00:09:34,039
If you really are, as you claim,

156
00:09:34,360 --> 00:09:35,879
that in love with your husband,

157
00:09:38,759 --> 00:09:41,600
then let me see, Miss Ge,

158
00:09:43,600 --> 00:09:44,600
whether you're willing

159
00:09:46,360 --> 00:09:49,480
to gamble your life for him.

160
00:09:53,440 --> 00:09:55,320
If you dare to pull the trigger,

161
00:09:56,440 --> 00:09:58,000
I'll believe you truly love him.

162
00:09:58,799 --> 00:10:00,279
Because I don't believe a cop

163
00:10:00,279 --> 00:10:02,480
would throw away their life on a mission.

164
00:10:03,000 --> 00:10:06,840
But I do believe,

165
00:10:07,639 --> 00:10:08,639
just as you said,

166
00:10:09,559 --> 00:10:10,679
in the power of love.

167
00:10:16,120 --> 00:10:17,480
Whether you save your husband

168
00:10:17,480 --> 00:10:18,320
is entirely up to you.

169
00:10:19,039 --> 00:10:20,360
If you don't want to do this,

170
00:10:21,080 --> 00:10:22,240
you can just turn around and walk away.

171
00:10:22,240 --> 00:10:24,480
I'll pretend nothing ever happened.

172
00:10:26,559 --> 00:10:28,080
If you really are a cop,

173
00:10:29,440 --> 00:10:31,559
don't worry, I won't kill you either.

174
00:10:33,679 --> 00:10:34,279
Because,

175
00:10:36,960 --> 00:10:38,600
even if I kill one cop,

176
00:10:39,840 --> 00:10:41,360
they'll just send others

177
00:10:41,360 --> 00:10:42,399
to keep eyes on me.

178
00:10:51,759 --> 00:10:52,960
On every mission,

179
00:10:53,840 --> 00:10:55,039
I never want to see you get hurt.

180
00:11:02,960 --> 00:11:05,279
If danger strikes in future operations,

181
00:11:05,679 --> 00:11:06,759
protect yourself first.

182
00:11:07,080 --> 00:11:08,200
No matter what happens to me,

183
00:11:08,360 --> 00:11:09,080
don't try to save me.

184
00:11:09,399 --> 00:11:10,440
All right, I promise.

185
00:11:11,159 --> 00:11:13,080
I need you to truly mean it.

186
00:11:19,720 --> 00:11:20,320
I promise.

187
00:11:27,919 --> 00:11:28,799
I'm just worried about you.

188
00:11:32,759 --> 00:11:33,559
Remember what I said.

189
00:11:34,799 --> 00:11:36,240
I'll definitely make it back safe.

190
00:11:38,159 --> 00:11:38,879
Trust me.

191
00:11:44,799 --> 00:11:45,480
Besides,

192
00:11:46,240 --> 00:11:47,960
our powerful motherland has our back,

193
00:11:48,200 --> 00:11:48,679
doesn't it?

194
00:12:28,080 --> 00:12:29,879
Having danced on the edge of death,

195
00:12:30,600 --> 00:12:31,720
how does that feel?

196
00:12:32,759 --> 00:12:34,440
The moment you pulled the trigger,

197
00:12:34,759 --> 00:12:35,960
did you hesitate for even a second?

198
00:12:37,279 --> 00:12:38,559
I told you I love him.

199
00:12:40,360 --> 00:12:41,600
That's why I have to save him.

200
00:12:42,919 --> 00:12:44,279
And what if it kills you this time?

201
00:12:59,519 --> 00:13:00,480
You're not a cop.

202
00:13:01,440 --> 00:13:02,799
If you were a cop,

203
00:13:03,039 --> 00:13:04,159
you'd have pointed that gun at me.

204
00:13:07,960 --> 00:13:09,080
I believe you.

205
00:13:11,639 --> 00:13:12,120
Goodbye.

206
00:13:31,360 --> 00:13:32,519
I'm sorry, Miss Ge.

207
00:13:33,159 --> 00:13:34,440
I was just kidding with you.

208
00:13:46,440 --> 00:13:48,519
You certainly have character, Miss Ge.

209
00:13:48,799 --> 00:13:49,840
I'm sure your husband

210
00:13:49,840 --> 00:13:51,200
is no ordinary man either.

211
00:13:52,279 --> 00:13:54,440
If you manage to get your husband out,

212
00:13:54,720 --> 00:13:55,399
have him come see me.

213
00:14:01,480 --> 00:14:02,639
Take her to see Miss Li.

214
00:14:03,679 --> 00:14:04,200
Yes, sir.

215
00:14:06,519 --> 00:14:06,919
This way, please.

216
00:14:27,679 --> 00:14:28,679
The plan is going smoothly.

217
00:14:29,000 --> 00:14:29,559
Our operative

218
00:14:29,559 --> 00:14:30,879
has earned Ma Jingrong's trust.

219
00:14:31,279 --> 00:14:32,440
We can move to the next step.

220
00:14:32,840 --> 00:14:35,360
Mr. Mai, what's your next move?

221
00:14:37,519 --> 00:14:38,120
A prison break.

222
00:14:38,679 --> 00:14:39,480
Are you sure?

223
00:14:40,759 --> 00:14:41,799
After Liang Wenbiao woke up,

224
00:14:41,799 --> 00:14:44,159
he confessed to the Black Panther Club crimes.

225
00:14:44,559 --> 00:14:45,840
Based on his confession,

226
00:14:46,000 --> 00:14:47,759
we arrested his drug-dealing subordinates.

227
00:14:48,039 --> 00:14:49,240
So far, the number of suspects arrested

228
00:14:49,399 --> 00:14:50,279
has reached 17.

229
00:14:50,440 --> 00:14:51,679
Also, the casinos run by Liang Wenbiao

230
00:14:51,679 --> 00:14:52,879
have all been shut down.

231
00:14:53,159 --> 00:14:54,159
The suspects involved

232
00:14:54,159 --> 00:14:55,919
are now under our investigation.

233
00:14:58,279 --> 00:14:59,320
Can we confirm

234
00:14:59,480 --> 00:15:01,159
whether the one dealing with Liang Wenbiao

235
00:15:01,320 --> 00:15:02,279
was Four-Legged Snake?

236
00:15:02,480 --> 00:15:03,080
No.

237
00:15:03,559 --> 00:15:06,279
Liang denied ties to Four-Legged Snake.

238
00:15:06,399 --> 00:15:08,039
He said that on the day of the deal,

239
00:15:08,720 --> 00:15:10,120
he was only in contact with Li Qiang,

240
00:15:10,399 --> 00:15:12,480
and had no idea a third party was involved.

241
00:15:15,960 --> 00:15:17,480
Zhou Fuhai committed suicide to escape justice.

242
00:15:17,799 --> 00:15:19,240
Li Qiang's whereabouts are unknown.

243
00:15:20,039 --> 00:15:21,879
Four-Legged Snake's identity is unknown.

244
00:15:25,039 --> 00:15:27,320
Looks like we've hit a dead end again.

245
00:15:34,360 --> 00:15:37,879
Weiyuan International was dissolved last month.

246
00:15:38,840 --> 00:15:41,559
Gu Xiaoyi's investigation into Chen Hai

247
00:15:41,559 --> 00:15:43,799
only proves he laundered money at best.

248
00:15:45,039 --> 00:15:46,720
Right now, aside from Qian Feng's testimony,

249
00:15:47,200 --> 00:15:48,480
we have no evidence

250
00:15:49,279 --> 00:15:51,120
to implicate him in drug trafficking.

251
00:15:56,919 --> 00:15:58,399
Chief, Captain Bai, Captain Lu.

252
00:15:58,679 --> 00:15:59,919
The forensics report is out.

253
00:16:00,600 --> 00:16:01,080
What are the results?

254
00:16:01,399 --> 00:16:02,519
None of the DNA samples from Longze Group's

255
00:16:02,519 --> 00:16:03,480
security team members

256
00:16:03,679 --> 00:16:05,679
matched the samples found on the victim

257
00:16:05,679 --> 00:16:06,399
at East Mountain Park.

258
00:16:06,600 --> 00:16:08,559
The weapon's trace evidence didn't match either.

259
00:16:12,960 --> 00:16:14,960
Was Hu Dong's trace evidence analyzed too?

260
00:16:15,320 --> 00:16:16,080
Yes, it was.

261
00:16:17,440 --> 00:16:18,519
Suspicions against Chen Hai

262
00:16:19,480 --> 00:16:20,440
have been ruled out.

263
00:16:26,320 --> 00:16:28,720
We've considered Chen Hai a prime suspect.

264
00:16:29,519 --> 00:16:30,279
But now,

265
00:16:30,840 --> 00:16:33,919
based on the evidence and facts,

266
00:16:35,480 --> 00:16:38,279
we can only release Chen Hai from Detention.

267
00:16:47,080 --> 00:16:48,559
Looks like everyone's a bit discouraged.

268
00:16:49,759 --> 00:16:52,240
Months of investigation hitting a deadlock,

269
00:16:54,480 --> 00:16:55,720
I understand how you feel.

270
00:16:58,519 --> 00:17:00,559
In fact, our opponents have been making moves.

271
00:17:01,200 --> 00:17:02,759
It looks calm on the surface,

272
00:17:02,799 --> 00:17:04,400
but dangerous undercurrents run deep.

273
00:17:05,519 --> 00:17:08,279
The fact that Hu Dong took drug money from Zhao Jianfeng

274
00:17:08,279 --> 00:17:09,039
is largely established.

275
00:17:09,240 --> 00:17:12,359
Four-Legged Snake's contact with Xu Duoduo and Liang Wenbiao

276
00:17:12,480 --> 00:17:14,079
is also confirmed by our investigation.

277
00:17:14,440 --> 00:17:15,480
All these points...

278
00:17:15,960 --> 00:17:17,359
There are plenty of new leads

279
00:17:17,359 --> 00:17:18,920
waiting for us to investigate thoroughly.

280
00:17:19,920 --> 00:17:21,200
Even if there are no new leads,

281
00:17:21,359 --> 00:17:24,079
we will re-examine the facts we already have

282
00:17:25,000 --> 00:17:25,599
and find the flaws.

283
00:17:26,839 --> 00:17:27,359
I believe that

284
00:17:28,160 --> 00:17:29,240
as long as we keep our faith,

285
00:17:30,000 --> 00:17:32,079
we will expose these criminals and bring them down.

286
00:17:35,680 --> 00:17:36,079
Captain Bai.

287
00:18:05,079 --> 00:18:07,519
Your husband is suspected of a major robbery.

288
00:18:08,119 --> 00:18:09,640
The police are still investigating the case,

289
00:18:09,640 --> 00:18:11,480
so I can't grant your request.

290
00:18:12,119 --> 00:18:13,880
Until my husband stands trial,

291
00:18:13,880 --> 00:18:15,359
no one can convict him.

292
00:18:15,839 --> 00:18:17,160
Under the laws of Country M,

293
00:18:17,160 --> 00:18:18,279
I have the right to visit him.

294
00:18:18,720 --> 00:18:21,960
Your husband was involved in a severe felony.

295
00:18:22,640 --> 00:18:24,680
We not only have the right to see Mr. Zhuang,

296
00:18:24,799 --> 00:18:26,279
we also have the right to provide him

297
00:18:26,279 --> 00:18:27,000
with legal services.

298
00:18:27,240 --> 00:18:28,839
Mr. Zhuang is a Chinese citizen.

299
00:18:29,880 --> 00:18:31,079
If in dealing with Mr. Zhuang,

300
00:18:31,079 --> 00:18:32,960
you violate the basic spirit of the law,

301
00:18:34,519 --> 00:18:37,240
it could trigger a major outcry from Country M's Chinese.

302
00:18:37,240 --> 00:18:38,039
Who are you?

303
00:18:46,079 --> 00:18:47,599
Country M's Chief Chinese Counsel,

304
00:18:47,599 --> 00:18:48,440
Mai Zhaohui.

305
00:18:49,519 --> 00:18:51,759
If you don't want any trouble,

306
00:18:51,920 --> 00:18:52,960
you'd better arrange

307
00:18:52,960 --> 00:18:54,799
a meeting with Mr. Zhuang.

308
00:19:19,319 --> 00:19:20,559
What are you doing here?

309
00:19:21,000 --> 00:19:22,119
I came to see my husband.

310
00:19:27,599 --> 00:19:28,200
All right.

311
00:19:30,000 --> 00:19:32,559
Li Siqi doesn't trust the people Tony found.

312
00:19:32,680 --> 00:19:34,440
She found someone to help get you out.

313
00:19:34,640 --> 00:19:35,920
She wants me to wait with her for you

314
00:19:35,920 --> 00:19:36,960
and Mr. Ma to get out.

315
00:19:37,079 --> 00:19:39,359
Then we'll go see Mr. Theerade.

316
00:19:39,680 --> 00:19:40,279
Listen to me.

317
00:19:40,440 --> 00:19:42,119
All of this is my business.

318
00:19:42,799 --> 00:19:44,160
Don't get involved.

319
00:19:44,640 --> 00:19:46,359
I'm going to wait for my husband myself.

320
00:19:46,680 --> 00:19:47,559
No matter what happens,

321
00:19:48,759 --> 00:19:50,319
I'll stand by you through life and death.

322
00:19:51,559 --> 00:19:53,000
Please send my wife back to China.

323
00:19:53,119 --> 00:19:54,759
Mr. Zhuang, please calm down.

324
00:19:54,920 --> 00:19:55,519
Sit down.

325
00:19:57,480 --> 00:19:58,640
I'm not leaving.

326
00:19:59,359 --> 00:20:00,200
Tonight,

327
00:20:00,400 --> 00:20:01,640
I'll go meet with Li Siqi

328
00:20:01,720 --> 00:20:02,799
and Qin Mu.

329
00:20:04,079 --> 00:20:04,920
Tony's men

330
00:20:05,599 --> 00:20:06,599
will find a way

331
00:20:06,680 --> 00:20:08,640
to pass word to you on what we decide.

332
00:20:08,640 --> 00:20:09,519
Until then,

333
00:20:10,799 --> 00:20:12,440
get to know the surroundings here well.

334
00:20:12,680 --> 00:20:13,599
Qin Mu?

335
00:20:14,799 --> 00:20:16,759
How did you get mixed up with them?

336
00:20:17,200 --> 00:20:18,519
I'll come back to see you.

337
00:20:20,720 --> 00:20:21,440
Mr. Zhuang.

338
00:20:22,400 --> 00:20:23,599
Your wife is quite remarkable.

339
00:20:24,119 --> 00:20:25,119
I really envy you.

340
00:20:34,519 --> 00:20:35,000
Take care.

341
00:20:38,839 --> 00:20:39,519
You too.

342
00:21:08,960 --> 00:21:10,279
I've coordinated with the Xilano police

343
00:21:10,279 --> 00:21:11,640
on the prison break.

344
00:21:12,079 --> 00:21:13,039
They've agreed to it.

345
00:21:13,599 --> 00:21:14,480
On one condition:

346
00:21:14,680 --> 00:21:15,880
there can be no casualties.

347
00:21:19,359 --> 00:21:19,920
Understood.

348
00:21:21,319 --> 00:21:22,160
Be careful.

349
00:21:25,160 --> 00:21:25,720
Now go.

350
00:21:44,279 --> 00:21:45,240
When you left,

351
00:21:45,680 --> 00:21:47,440
did Jiang Liye have anyone tail you?

352
00:21:48,440 --> 00:21:48,960
No.

353
00:21:49,920 --> 00:21:50,559
In a matter like this,

354
00:21:50,599 --> 00:21:52,359
he'll definitely keep himself out of it.

355
00:21:55,319 --> 00:21:56,559
Still, someone like Jiang Liye

356
00:21:56,680 --> 00:21:58,079
is suspicious by nature.

357
00:21:58,680 --> 00:22:01,240
He rarely takes anyone at their word.

358
00:22:02,119 --> 00:22:03,559
The one he trusts isn't me.

359
00:22:04,240 --> 00:22:04,880
It's her.

360
00:22:14,440 --> 00:22:15,599
So you're Ge Xiaobai.

361
00:23:46,960 --> 00:23:47,400
Who are you?

362
00:23:48,480 --> 00:23:50,759
You'd better tell me who you are first.

363
00:23:52,279 --> 00:23:53,799
Boss Qin sent you, right?

364
00:23:54,839 --> 00:23:56,240
You're an undercover cop.

365
00:24:02,759 --> 00:24:03,839
This is your gun.

366
00:24:04,839 --> 00:24:05,720
I checked it.

367
00:24:06,200 --> 00:24:07,200
There are no bullets in it.

368
00:24:13,440 --> 00:24:14,359
About what happened today...

369
00:24:14,960 --> 00:24:16,759
you'd better not tell your superior.

370
00:24:17,680 --> 00:24:19,079
When the time is right,

371
00:24:19,359 --> 00:24:20,720
Country M Police Headquarters

372
00:24:20,759 --> 00:24:22,240
will explain everything to your superior.

373
00:24:23,400 --> 00:24:24,880
Right now, the Xilano Police Department

374
00:24:24,880 --> 00:24:26,759
has moles for Theerade and Piyazi.

375
00:24:27,079 --> 00:24:27,839
Some of them,

376
00:24:28,240 --> 00:24:30,480
even your superior might not know about.

377
00:24:33,000 --> 00:24:33,839
From now on,

378
00:24:34,079 --> 00:24:35,240
you'll need to cooperate with me.

379
00:24:39,759 --> 00:24:42,920
This is a special order from Country M Police.

380
00:24:43,640 --> 00:24:46,200
Remember to destroy it once you've read it.

381
00:24:58,799 --> 00:25:00,119
If someone wants to get into your room,

382
00:25:00,160 --> 00:25:01,359
there are plenty of ways.

383
00:25:02,799 --> 00:25:03,599
Be careful from now on.

384
00:25:20,279 --> 00:25:21,759
Poison their cellmates,

385
00:25:22,079 --> 00:25:23,400
and have them sent to the infirmary.

386
00:25:24,920 --> 00:25:26,039
Once the infirmary doctors

387
00:25:26,119 --> 00:25:27,559
see their lives are in danger,

388
00:25:27,799 --> 00:25:29,359
they'll contact the nearest hospital.

389
00:25:29,440 --> 00:25:31,000
Could it actually be life-threatening?

390
00:25:31,079 --> 00:25:32,519
They'll show signs of dying,

391
00:25:32,799 --> 00:25:35,200
but it's just an effect of the drug.

392
00:25:35,440 --> 00:25:36,599
Within two hours,

393
00:25:36,759 --> 00:25:38,240
once the drug breaks down in their body,

394
00:25:38,440 --> 00:25:39,559
they'll be completely fine.

395
00:25:47,400 --> 00:25:48,480
What do you think you're doing?

396
00:25:48,480 --> 00:25:49,200
I'm sorry, boss! My mistake!

397
00:25:49,279 --> 00:25:50,759
It's my fault, I'm sorry, I'm sorry!

398
00:25:51,400 --> 00:25:52,160
Boss, I deserve to die!

399
00:25:52,319 --> 00:25:53,240
I was wrong, I'm sorry, I'm sorry!

400
00:25:53,440 --> 00:25:54,319
Boss, I was wrong!

401
00:25:54,359 --> 00:25:54,880
I deserve to die!

402
00:25:55,200 --> 00:25:56,599
I deserve to die! I deserve to die!

403
00:25:57,559 --> 00:25:58,160
I'm sorry, boss!

404
00:25:58,160 --> 00:25:59,279
I was wrong! I'm truly sorry!

405
00:25:59,279 --> 00:26:00,000
I'm so sorry!

406
00:26:00,000 --> 00:26:00,720
I'm sorry, I'm sorry!

407
00:26:00,720 --> 00:26:01,359
I'm sorry, boss!

408
00:26:01,880 --> 00:26:02,519
Please, I beg you!

409
00:26:02,960 --> 00:26:04,880
Let me get you another bowl of soup!

410
00:26:05,039 --> 00:26:06,880
I'm sorry, I'm sorry, I'm sorry!

411
00:26:07,960 --> 00:26:10,400
I'm sorry, I'm sorry, I'm sorry!

412
00:26:11,759 --> 00:26:12,279
I'm sorry!

413
00:26:33,279 --> 00:26:34,920
We just need to get an ambulance

414
00:26:34,960 --> 00:26:36,119
smoothly into the prison,

415
00:26:36,160 --> 00:26:39,039
so poisoning anyone will work.

416
00:27:03,759 --> 00:27:05,559
Officer! Officer!

417
00:27:21,279 --> 00:27:23,400
Mind your own business. Keep eating.

418
00:27:30,480 --> 00:27:31,799
But this kind of illusion

419
00:27:32,039 --> 00:27:33,799
can only fool ordinary eyes.

420
00:27:34,160 --> 00:27:36,119
We also need to bribe the prison doctor.

421
00:27:37,440 --> 00:27:40,119
Fine. I'll pay whatever it takes.

422
00:27:43,200 --> 00:27:43,960
What's the situation?

423
00:27:44,200 --> 00:27:44,839
Not sure yet.

424
00:27:49,359 --> 00:27:51,400
Call an ambulance! Hurry!

425
00:27:52,039 --> 00:27:52,640
Warden,

426
00:27:52,799 --> 00:27:54,640
an inmate has had a sudden emergency.

427
00:27:54,799 --> 00:27:56,759
The doctor says he needs resuscitation now.

428
00:27:57,720 --> 00:27:59,279
Once the ambulance reaches the prison

429
00:27:59,279 --> 00:28:00,519
and picks up the three of them,

430
00:28:01,039 --> 00:28:01,799
Mr. Qin,

431
00:28:02,119 --> 00:28:04,640
your men can intercept it en route.

432
00:28:06,599 --> 00:28:08,319
They're high-security convicts.

433
00:28:09,440 --> 00:28:11,000
During transport,

434
00:28:11,119 --> 00:28:13,039
the prison will send at least two guards

435
00:28:13,039 --> 00:28:13,759
to watch them.

436
00:28:14,960 --> 00:28:18,000
Plus the escort cars in front and behind,

437
00:28:18,480 --> 00:28:20,079
we won't have any chance

438
00:28:20,240 --> 00:28:21,480
to intercept that ambulance.

439
00:28:22,000 --> 00:28:22,960
And even if

440
00:28:22,960 --> 00:28:24,759
we successfully intercept the ambulance,

441
00:28:25,880 --> 00:28:27,440
during the subsequent rescue,

442
00:28:27,920 --> 00:28:28,680
there'll still be plenty of

443
00:28:28,720 --> 00:28:30,319
unforeseen complications.

444
00:28:33,279 --> 00:28:34,119
So,

445
00:28:34,519 --> 00:28:36,000
we must make sure the police

446
00:28:36,079 --> 00:28:37,599
don't come out with the ambulance.

447
00:28:41,200 --> 00:28:43,359
We'll intercept the ambulance as planned,

448
00:28:43,680 --> 00:28:44,440
except

449
00:28:44,480 --> 00:28:46,599
it'll be on its way to the prison.

450
00:28:47,319 --> 00:28:48,160
Get out of the car!

451
00:28:49,759 --> 00:28:51,119
Officer, please don't kill me!

452
00:29:07,039 --> 00:29:09,759
According to my husband's prison file,

453
00:29:09,799 --> 00:29:11,799
he's an electrical engineer.

454
00:29:12,599 --> 00:29:13,799
The prison's backup generator

455
00:29:13,839 --> 00:29:15,640
is usually run during peak hours,

456
00:29:15,720 --> 00:29:16,279
which is

457
00:29:16,319 --> 00:29:18,880
between one and five in the afternoon.

458
00:29:18,960 --> 00:29:20,799
We need to tamper with it beforehand

459
00:29:21,000 --> 00:29:22,279
so that when it starts up,

460
00:29:22,319 --> 00:29:23,160
it malfunctions.

461
00:29:23,920 --> 00:29:25,559
The generator was made in China,

462
00:29:25,759 --> 00:29:27,920
the guards will have my husband check it.

463
00:29:28,559 --> 00:29:30,359
Of course, to ensure it goes smoothly,

464
00:29:30,519 --> 00:29:31,960
we'll still need to pay off

465
00:29:32,000 --> 00:29:33,440
the head guard on duty that day.

466
00:29:34,720 --> 00:29:35,759
Money is not a problem.

467
00:29:55,440 --> 00:29:56,519
Are you Chinese?

468
00:29:59,039 --> 00:30:00,920
Our generator broke down.

469
00:30:00,920 --> 00:30:02,839
Can you fix a generator?

470
00:30:04,440 --> 00:30:06,079
He's asking if you can fix the generator.

471
00:30:08,680 --> 00:30:10,200
Great. You two, come with me.

472
00:30:11,359 --> 00:30:12,200
Tell him...

473
00:30:12,359 --> 00:30:13,480
...I need another helper.

474
00:30:14,440 --> 00:30:16,359
He says he needs another helper.

475
00:30:16,880 --> 00:30:18,920
Ask who in here is willing to help him.

476
00:30:26,200 --> 00:30:26,720
Okay.

477
00:30:27,640 --> 00:30:28,160
Listen up!

478
00:30:43,839 --> 00:30:45,599
Can this be fixed?

479
00:30:46,720 --> 00:30:48,160
He's asking if it can be fixed.

480
00:31:07,279 --> 00:31:08,000
Two hours.

481
00:31:08,160 --> 00:31:09,319
And some tools.

482
00:31:10,319 --> 00:31:11,359
It'll take two hours.

483
00:31:11,599 --> 00:31:12,920
He needs some repair tools.

484
00:31:14,559 --> 00:31:16,960
Give him what he needs.

485
00:31:22,200 --> 00:31:24,039
When the ambulance enters the prison,

486
00:31:24,079 --> 00:31:25,480
we need to spend some money

487
00:31:25,640 --> 00:31:27,319
to get two prison gangs

488
00:31:27,319 --> 00:31:28,680
to start a riot.

489
00:32:15,599 --> 00:32:17,359
There's a riot in the yard.

490
00:32:17,599 --> 00:32:19,880
All personnel, provide backup!

491
00:32:19,880 --> 00:32:21,920
Make sure it's fixed within an hour.

492
00:32:42,559 --> 00:32:43,440
From the electrical room,

493
00:32:43,519 --> 00:32:45,559
you can get into the infirmary's ceiling.

494
00:33:19,079 --> 00:33:20,240
You're finally here.

495
00:34:00,839 --> 00:34:01,640
What happened to me?

496
00:34:04,160 --> 00:34:05,119
Where am I?

497
00:34:13,440 --> 00:34:14,760
Are you sure something is wrong with him?

498
00:34:21,199 --> 00:34:21,960
What's the situation?

499
00:34:22,360 --> 00:34:23,519
His condition has stabilized.

500
00:34:23,800 --> 00:34:25,760
No, or rather, this guy isn't sick at all.

501
00:34:40,440 --> 00:34:42,039
Did you drug yourself

502
00:34:42,039 --> 00:34:43,840
to try and escape?

503
00:34:44,199 --> 00:34:45,079
I don't know.

504
00:34:49,719 --> 00:34:50,679
You can go now.

505
00:35:24,880 --> 00:35:26,199
The key to this operation

506
00:35:26,400 --> 00:35:28,280
is whether we can adapt flexibly

507
00:35:28,440 --> 00:35:29,599
to whatever we encounter that day,

508
00:35:29,639 --> 00:35:31,639
every potential human obstacle.

509
00:35:31,960 --> 00:35:33,280
So we must get in advance

510
00:35:33,280 --> 00:35:34,760
every prison guard's duty roster,

511
00:35:34,960 --> 00:35:36,360
and pinpoint their exact positions.

512
00:35:37,000 --> 00:35:39,199
Most critical are the guards at the gate.

513
00:35:39,320 --> 00:35:40,760
If they intercept us at the end,

514
00:35:41,280 --> 00:35:42,599
it'll all be for nothing.

515
00:35:47,519 --> 00:35:48,159
Stop.

516
00:35:54,719 --> 00:35:56,079
We're not needed here anymore.

517
00:36:07,960 --> 00:36:08,960
Open the gate and let them through.

518
00:36:19,000 --> 00:36:21,039
In coordination with Interpol,

519
00:36:21,519 --> 00:36:24,519
Chinese and Country M police managed to

520
00:36:24,639 --> 00:36:26,840
get Zhuang Yan inside the drug cartel.

521
00:36:29,599 --> 00:36:31,880
Reporting. Mission accomplished.

522
00:36:32,199 --> 00:36:35,480
In three hours, announce a prison break.

523
00:36:35,719 --> 00:36:36,360
Yes, sir.

524
00:36:37,960 --> 00:36:40,599
This is the daunting task they are facing.

525
00:36:40,840 --> 00:36:43,280
Yeah, it always has been.

526
00:37:13,960 --> 00:37:14,840
Why are you out of bed?

527
00:37:15,400 --> 00:37:16,280
The doctor said

528
00:37:16,440 --> 00:37:17,719
you still need to rest for a while.

529
00:37:19,360 --> 00:37:21,840
Four-Legged Snake and Liang played Li Qiang.

530
00:37:22,760 --> 00:37:24,039
He'll definitely seek revenge.

531
00:37:24,360 --> 00:37:25,320
Right now,

532
00:37:25,840 --> 00:37:26,920
if we find Four-Legged Snake,

533
00:37:26,960 --> 00:37:28,719
we might have a chance to catch Li Qiang.

534
00:37:30,000 --> 00:37:32,639
Did Liang say where Four-Legged Snake is?

535
00:37:34,400 --> 00:37:34,960
No.

536
00:37:41,519 --> 00:37:42,280
Where are you going?

537
00:37:42,840 --> 00:37:45,000
Captain Bai said you can't act on your own.

538
00:37:45,400 --> 00:37:46,119
Officer Li.

539
00:37:46,480 --> 00:37:47,199
I need to see Liang Wenbiao.

540
00:37:48,039 --> 00:37:48,880
Our captain said

541
00:37:49,039 --> 00:37:50,119
no one is allowed to see him.

542
00:37:50,920 --> 00:37:52,159
Officer Li! Officer Li!

543
00:37:52,719 --> 00:37:53,159
Officer Li!

544
00:37:58,599 --> 00:38:01,159
Are you teaming up with Four-Legged Snake against Li Qiang?

545
00:38:01,559 --> 00:38:02,800
Where is he right now?

546
00:38:22,760 --> 00:38:24,599
I'm asking you, where is he right now?

547
00:38:24,639 --> 00:38:25,239
Li Xiao.

548
00:38:25,360 --> 00:38:25,920
Talk!

549
00:38:26,039 --> 00:38:26,800
Li Xiao! Li Xiao!

550
00:38:26,840 --> 00:38:27,440
Answer me!

551
00:38:27,480 --> 00:38:28,079
Li Xiao, calm down!

552
00:38:28,159 --> 00:38:28,719
Where is he? Talk!

553
00:38:28,719 --> 00:38:29,679
Calm down!

554
00:38:29,760 --> 00:38:30,199
I'm asking you!

555
00:38:30,199 --> 00:38:31,400
Li Xiao, calm down!

556
00:38:31,400 --> 00:38:32,280
Where is he right now?

557
00:38:32,280 --> 00:38:32,960
You need to calm down!

558
00:38:35,159 --> 00:38:36,039
I already asked him.

559
00:38:36,400 --> 00:38:37,559
Now isn't the right time.

560
00:39:03,760 --> 00:39:04,440
I'm sorry.

561
00:39:39,880 --> 00:39:40,559
What is it?

562
00:39:40,760 --> 00:39:41,239
Captain Lu.

563
00:39:41,800 --> 00:39:43,639
I suspect Liang's medication was swapped.

564
00:39:44,199 --> 00:39:45,559
The suspect is heading toward the elevator.

565
00:39:46,559 --> 00:39:47,360
Got it.

566
00:39:51,800 --> 00:39:53,039
Secure Liang Wenbiao's medicine.

567
00:39:53,239 --> 00:39:54,199
Don't let anyone touch it.

568
00:39:54,239 --> 00:39:54,599
Yes, sir.

569
00:39:54,639 --> 00:39:55,719
We've got a situation. Follow me!

570
00:40:41,239 --> 00:40:41,719
Cuff him.

571
00:40:51,199 --> 00:40:51,679
Take him away.

572
00:41:14,639 --> 00:41:15,159
Brother Rong.

573
00:41:21,599 --> 00:41:22,400
I knew

574
00:41:23,000 --> 00:41:24,360
you'd send someone to break me out.

575
00:41:26,480 --> 00:41:27,159
And I knew

576
00:41:27,760 --> 00:41:29,679
you'd find a way to come see me.

577
00:41:30,519 --> 00:41:31,760
Thank you, Mr. Qin.

578
00:41:32,440 --> 00:41:33,159
Don't mention it.

579
00:41:36,400 --> 00:41:37,440
You must be that...

580
00:41:37,519 --> 00:41:39,000
infamous robber.

581
00:41:40,760 --> 00:41:42,159
That's right, that's right.

582
00:41:42,199 --> 00:41:45,960
Make that two infamous robbers.

583
00:41:47,760 --> 00:41:49,159
Are you really just a businessman?

584
00:41:54,440 --> 00:41:55,199
Mr. Zhuang,

585
00:41:55,840 --> 00:41:57,400
you'll soon be wanted by the police.

586
00:41:58,159 --> 00:41:59,920
You can never go back to your old life.

587
00:42:00,440 --> 00:42:01,159
How about this?

588
00:42:01,400 --> 00:42:02,440
Why don't the two of you

589
00:42:02,519 --> 00:42:05,400
join me and Mr. Ma to partner with Mr. Jiang?

590
00:42:09,840 --> 00:42:10,880
I'm sorry, sir.

591
00:42:11,559 --> 00:42:12,840
After everything that's happened,

592
00:42:13,119 --> 00:42:13,960
my husband and I

593
00:42:14,239 --> 00:42:15,840
just want a quiet life.

594
00:42:16,519 --> 00:42:18,400
Besides, we know nothing about your business.

595
00:42:25,400 --> 00:42:26,000
All right.

596
00:42:26,440 --> 00:42:27,320
To each their own.

597
00:42:27,760 --> 00:42:29,480
I won't force you two.

598
00:43:04,880 --> 00:43:06,039
Mr. Jiang gave orders

599
00:43:06,480 --> 00:43:07,840
for all of you to go see him.

600
00:43:09,880 --> 00:43:11,360
If Mr. Jiang is inviting us,

601
00:43:12,880 --> 00:43:14,679
is all this force really necessary?

602
00:43:14,679 --> 00:43:15,920
You carry a lot of weight, Mr. Qin.

603
00:43:16,360 --> 00:43:17,800
We were worried that with fewer men,

604
00:43:18,440 --> 00:43:19,440
you wouldn't come along.
